t=\\\\\\\"Screenshot\\\\\\\" /\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/picture\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n## Settings\\\\n\\\\n- `openInIntellij.basePath`: The absolute path on your computer where your git repositories live. This extension requires all git repos to be already cloned under this path with their original names. `\\\\\\\"/Users/yourusername/src\\\\\\\"` is a valid absolute path, while `\\\\\\\"~/src\\\\\\\"` is not.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"repository\\\": {\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"git\\\",\\n    \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/sourcegraph/sourcegraph-open-in-intellij\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"parcel build --out-file dist/open-in-intellij.js src/open-in-intellij.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"eslint 'src/**/*.ts'\\\",\\n    \\\"serve\\\": \\\"yarn run symlink-package \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 parcel serve --no-hmr --out-file dist/open-in-intellij.js src/open-in-intellij.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph:prepublish\\\": \\\"yarn run typecheck \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 yarn run build\\\",\\n    \\\"symlink-package\\\": \\\"mkdirp dist \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 lnfs ./package.json ./dist/package.json\\\",\\n    \\\"typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:build\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.dist.json -w\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json -w\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"tags\\\": [\\n    \\\"intellij\\\",\\n    \\\"editor\\\",\\n    \\\"open\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://sourcegraph.com/-/static/extension/8881-sourcegraph-open-in-intellij.js?c6kczi2h6520--sourcegraph-open-in-intellij\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.0.0-DEVELOPMENT\\\",\\n  \\\"wip\\\": false\\n}\",\"description\":\"Open the current file in the Intellij editor\"},\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-22T02:01:02Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2020-10-22T02:01:02Z\",\"url\":\"/extensions/sourcegraph/open-in-intellij\",\"remoteURL\":null,\"registryName\":\"\",\"isLocal\":true,\"isWorkInProgress\":false,\"viewerCanAdminister\":false},{\"id\":\"UmVnaXN0cnlFeHRlbnNpb246eyJsIjoyOTR9\",\"publisher\":{