anifest\":{\"raw\":\"{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sourcegraph/sourcegraph/main/client/shared/src/schema/extension.schema.json\\\",\\n  \\\"activationEvents\\\": [\\n    \\\"*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"browserslist\\\": [\\n    \\\"last 1 Chrome versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Firefox versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Edge versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Safari versions\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"categories\\\": [],\\n  \\\"contributes\\\": {\\n    \\\"actions\\\": [],\\n    \\\"configuration\\\": {},\\n    \\\"menus\\\": {\\n      \\\"commandPalette\\\": [],\\n      \\\"editor/title\\\": []\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"rxjs\\\": \\\"^6.6.3\\\",\\n    \\\"tagged-template-noop\\\": \\\"^2.1.1\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Contact the author of any line of code, directly from a file view.\\\",\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/eslint-config\\\": \\\"^0.20.11\\\",\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/tsconfig\\\": \\\"^4.0.1\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"^7.11.0\\\",\\n    \\\"lnfs-cli\\\": \\\"^2.1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"mkdirp\\\": \\\"^1.0.4\\\",\\n    \\\"parcel-bundler\\\": \\\"^1.12.4\\\",\\n    \\\"prettier\\\": \\\"^2.1.2\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph\\\": \\\"^24.7.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^4.0.3\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"extensionID\\\": \\\"sourcegraph/contact-author\\\",\\n  \\\"license\\\": \\\"Apache-2.0\\\",\\n  \\\"main\\\": \\\"dist/contact-author.js\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"contact-author\\\",\\n  \\\"publisher\\\": \\\"sourcegraph\\\",\\n  \\\"readme\\\": \\\"# Contact Author (Sourcegraph extension)\\\\n\\\\nSourcegraph extension that lets you contact the author of a particular line of code (the last author who modified of that line) by email.\\\\n\\\\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/602886/96913896-41efe480-1472-11eb-8c97-4fc075b2afb0.png)\\\\n\\\\n## How it works:\\\\n\\\\nWhen you select a line while browsing a source file, the extension appends a \\\\\\\"Contact author\\\\\\\" link next to the line.\\\\n\\\\nThe link is a `mailto:` link which will automatically open your default email client, and will pre-fill the recipient, subject and body of the email with the file name and the quoted line of code.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"parcel build --out-file dist/contact-author.js src/contact-author.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"eslint 'src/**/*.ts'\\\",\\n    \\\"prettier\\\": \\\"prettier '**/*.{ts,md}' --write --list-different\\\",\\n    \\\"serve\\\": \\\"yarn run symlink-package \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 parcel serve --no-hmr --out-file dist/contact-author.js src/contact-author.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph:prepublish\\\": \\\"yarn run typecheck \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 yarn run build\\\",\\n    \\\"symlink-package\\\": \\\"mkdirp dist \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 lnfs ./package.json ./dist/package.json\\\",\\n    \\\"typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:build\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.dist.json -w\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json -w\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"tags\\\": [],\\n  \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://sourcegraph.com/-/static/extension/8841-sourcegraph-contact-author.js?c6jrhvw11jk0--sourcegraph-contact-author\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.0.0-DEVELOPMENT\\\",\\n  \\\"wip\\\": true\\n}\",\"description\":\"Contact the author of any line of code, directly from a file view.\"},\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-22T22:10:07Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2020-10-22T22:10:07Z\",\"url\":\"/extensions/sourcegraph/contact-author\",\"remoteURL\":null,\"registryName\":\"\",\"isLocal\":true,\"isWorkInProgress\":true,\"viewerCanAdminister\":false},{\"id\":\"UmVnaXN0cnlFeHRlbnNpb246eyJsIjoyOTZ9\",\"publisher\":{\"__typename\":\"Org\",\"id\":\"T3JnOjE=\",\"name\":\"sourcegraph\",\"displayName\":\"Sourcegraph\",\"url\":\"/organizations/sourcegraph\"},\"extensionID\":\"sourcegraph/who-knows-about-this\",\"extensionIDWithoutRegistry\":\"sourcegraph/who-knows-about-this\",\"name\":\"who-knows-about-this\",\"manifest\":{\"raw\":\"{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sourcegraph/sourcegraph/main/client/shared/src/schema/extension.schema.json\\\",\\n  \\\"activationEvents\\\": [\\n    \\\"*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"browserslist\\\": [\\n    \\\"last 1 Chrome versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Firefox versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Edge versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Safari versions\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"categories\\\": [],\\n  \\\"contributes\\\": {\\n    \\\"actions\\\": [],\\n    \\\"configuration\\\": {},\\n    \\\"menus\\\": {\\n      \\\"commandPalette\\\": [],\\n      \\\"editor/title\\\": []\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"lodash\\\": \\\"^4.17.20\\\",\\n    \\\"rxjs\\\": \\\"^6.6.3\\\",\\n    \\\"tagged-template-noop\\\": \\\"^2.1.1\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Find out who might know about a particular area of code.\\\",\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/eslint-config\\\": \\\"^0.20.12\\\",\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/tsconfig\\\": \\\"^4.0.1\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/lodash\\\": \\\"^4.14.162\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"^7.11.0\\\",\\n    \\\"lnfs-cli\\\": \\\"^2.1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"mkdirp\\\": \\\"^1.0.4\\\",\\n    \\\"parcel-bundler\\\": \\\"^1.12.4\\\",\\n    \\\"prettier\\\": \\\"^2.1.2\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph\\\": \\\"^24.7.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^4.0.3\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"extensionID\\\": \\\"sourcegraph/who-knows-about-this\\\",\\n  \\\"license\\\": \\\"Apache-2.0\\\",\\n  \\\"main\\\": \\\"dist/who-knows-about-this.js\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"who-knows-about-this\\\",\\n  \\\"publisher\\\": \\\"sourcegraph\\\",\\n  \\\"readme\\\": \\\"# who-knows-about-this (Sourcegraph extension)\\\\n\\\\nFind out who might know about a particular area of code.\\\\n\\\\nHover over a token to get authors who have contributed to this area of the codebase.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cimg width=\\\\\\\"884\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/602886/96793508-87f16d80-13ca-11eb-9fd2-b4ff99fa671c.png\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"parcel build --out-file dist/who-knows-about-this.js src/who-knows-about-this.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"eslint 'src/**/*.ts'\\\",\\n    \\\"prettier\\\": \\\"prettier '**/*.{ts,md}' --write --list-different\\\",\\n    \\\"serve\\\": \\\"yarn run symlink-package \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 parcel serve --no-hmr --out-file dist/who-knows-about-this.js src/who-knows-about-this.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph:prepublish\\\": \\\"yarn run typecheck \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 yarn run build\\\",\\n    \\\"symlink-package\\\": \\\"mkdirp dist \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 lnfs ./package.json ./dist/package.json\\\",\\n    \\\"typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:build\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.dist.json -w\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json -w\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"tags\\\": [],\\n  \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://sourcegraph.com/-/static/extension/8842-sourcegraph-who-knows-about-this.js?c6jrm7vppxmg--sourcegraph-who-knows-about-this\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.0.0-DEVELOPMENT\\\",\\n  \\\"wip\\\": true\\n}\",\"description\":\"Find out who might know about a particular area of code.\"},\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-22T22:15:47Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2020-10-22T22:15:47Z\",\"url\":\"/extensions/sourcegraph/who-knows-about-this\",\"remoteURL\":null,\"registryName\":\"\",\"isLocal\":true,\"isWorkInProgress\":true,\"viewerCanAdminister\":false},{\"id\":\"UmVnaXN0cnlFeHRlbnNpb246eyJsIjoyOTh9\",\"publisher\":{\"__typename\":\"User\",\"id\":\"VXNlcjoyNTQ0Ng==\",\"username\":\"allenly\",\"displayName\":null,\"url\":\"/users/allenly\"},\"extensionID\":\"allenly/dreamer\",\"extensionIDWithoutRegistry\":\"allenly/dreamer\",\"name\":\"dreamer\",\"manifest\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-23T03:29:52Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2020-10-23T03:29:52Z\",\"url\":\"/extensions/allenly/dreamer\",\"remoteURL\":null,\"registryName\":\"\",\"isLocal\":true,\"isWorkInProgress\":true,\"viewerCanAdminister\":false},{\"id\":\"UmVnaXN0cnlFeHRlbnNpb246eyJsIjoyOTl9\",\"publisher\":{\"__typename\":\"User\",\"id\":\"VXNlcjoyNTQ3MA==\",\"username\":\"zahradabiri1374\",\"displayName\":null,\"url\":\"/users/zahradabiri1374\"},\"extensionID\":\"zahradabiri1374/zd\",\"extensionIDWithoutRegistry\":\"zahradabiri1374/zd\",\"name\":\"zd\",\"manifest\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-25T09:10:18Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2020-10-25T09:10:18Z\",\"url\":\"/extensions/zahradabiri1374/zd\",\"remoteURL\":null,\"registryName\":\"\",\"isLocal\":true,\"isWorkInProgress\":true,\"viewerCanAdminister\":false},{\"id\":\"UmVnaXN0cnlFeHRlbnNpb246eyJsIjozMDB9\",\"publisher\":{\"__typename\":\"Org\",\"id\":\"T3JnOjE=\",\"name\":\"sourcegraph\",\"displayName\":\"Sourcegraph\",\"url\":\"/organizations/sourcegraph\"},\"extensionID\":\"sourcegraph/snyk\",\"extensionIDWithoutRegistry\":\"sourcegraph/snyk\",\"name\":\"snyk\",\"manifest\":{\"raw\":\"{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sourcegraph/sourcegraph/main/client/shared/src/schema/extension.schema.json\\\",\\n  \\\"activationEvents\\\": [\\n    \\\"*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"browserslist\\\": [\\n    \\\"last 1 Chrome versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Firefox versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Edge versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Safari versions\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"categories\\\": [\\n    \\\"External services\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"contributes\\\": {\\n    \\\"actions\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"actionItem\\\": {\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"See issues from the current project\\\",\\n          \\\"label\\\": \\\"Snyk\\\"\\n        },\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"Snyk\\\",\\n        \\\"command\\\": \\\"openPanel\\\",\\n        \\\"commandArguments\\\": [\\n          \\\"snyk.panel\\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"snyk.openPanel\\\",\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"Show panel\\\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"configuration\\\": {\\n      \\\"snyk.apiToken\\\": {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"A Snyk API token\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"snyk.corsAnywhereUrl\\\": {\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"https://cors-anywhere.herokuapp.com\\\",\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"The URL to a CORS proxy.\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"snyk.organizationKeyTemplate\\\": {\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"$1\\\",\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Replace string to build the organization key from the repository name pattern, using $n references for capture groups. By default just uses the first capture group\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"snyk.repositoryNamePattern\\\": {\\n        \\\"default\\\": \\\"(?:^|/)([^/]+)/([^/]+)$\\\",\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Regular expression with that is matched on the repository name to extract the capture groups for organization and project key templates.\\\",\\n        \\\"format\\\": \\\"regex\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"snyk.showNotifications\\\": {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Whether to show notifications when Snyk has found issues in the current project\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"boolean\\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\\"menus\\\": {\\n      \\\"commandPalette\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"action\\\": \\\"snyk.openPanel\\\",\\n          \\\"when\\\": \\\"resource\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"editor/title\\\": []\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"deepmerge\\\": \\\"^4.2.2\\\",\\n    \\\"rxjs\\\": \\\"^6.6.3\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Provides code insights from Snyk reports\\\",\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/eslint-config\\\": \\\"^0.20.11\\\",\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/extension-api-stubs\\\": \\\"^1.2.2\\\",\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/tsconfig\\\": \\\"^4.0.1\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/lodash\\\": \\\"^4.14.162\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/mocha\\\": \\\"^8.0.3\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/mock-require\\\": \\\"^2.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"^7.11.0\\\",\\n    \\\"lnfs-cli\\\": \\\"^2.1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"mkdirp\\\": \\\"^1.0.4\\\",\\n    \\\"mocha\\\": \\\"^5.2.0\\\",\\n    \\\"mock-require\\\": \\\"^3.0.3\\\",\\n    \\\"parcel-bundler\\\": \\\"^1.12.4\\\",\\n    \\\"sinon\\\": \\\"^9.2.0\\\",\\n    \\\"source-map-support\\\": \\\"^0.5.19\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph\\\": \\\"^24.7.0\\\",\\n    \\\"ts-node\\\": \\\"^9.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^4.0.3\\\",\\n    \\\"utility-types\\\": \\\"^3.10.0\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"extensionID\\\": \\\"sourcegraph/snyk\\\",\\n  \\\"license\\\": \\\"Apache-2.0\\\",\\n  \\\"main\\\": \\\"dist/snyk.js\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"snyk\\\",\\n  \\\"nyc\\\": {\\n    \\\"exclude\\\": [\\n      \\\"**/*.test.ts?(x)\\\",\\n      \\\"**/*.d.ts\\\",\\n      \\\"**/*.js\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"extension\\\": [\\n      \\\".tsx\\\",\\n      \\\".ts\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"include\\\": [\\n      \\\"src/**/*.ts?(x)\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"publisher\\\": \\\"sourcegraph\\\",\\n  \\\"readme\\\": \\\"# Snyk Sourcegraph extension\\\\n\\\\nProvides code insights from Snyk reports.\\\\n\\\\n**Status**: beta\\\\n\\\\n### Code Insight\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cp\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003cpicture\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003csource srcset=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37420160/97132254-b948a100-171c-11eb-8dac-d0c02b4ca946.png\\\\\\\" media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003csource srcset=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37420160/97132234-ac2bb200-171c-11eb-84ac-949c60ceeb82.png\\\\\\\" media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37420160/97132234-ac2bb200-171c-11eb-84ac-949c60ceeb82.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Screenshot\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/picture\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/p\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n### Notification + Panel View\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cp\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003cpicture\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003csource srcset=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37420160/97132302-d8dfc980-171c-11eb-9d5d-36379841cb3e.png\\\\\\\" media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003csource srcset=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37420160/97132290-cf566180-171c-11eb-8914-2c39d58cf593.png\\\\\\\" media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37420160/97132290-cf566180-171c-11eb-8914-2c39d58cf593.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Screenshot\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/picture\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/p\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n## Configuration\\\\n\\\\nThe extension can be configured through JSON in user, organization or global settings.\\\\n\\\\n```jsonc\\\\n{\\\\n  // A Snyk API token.\\\\n  \\\\\\\"snyk.apiToken\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"...\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\n  // Whether to show notifications when Snyk has found issues in the currently viewed project\\\\n  \\\\\\\"snyk.showNotifications\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n\\\\n  // The Snyk extension needs to map the repository on Sourcegraph to a project inside an organization on\\\\n  // Snyk. The default settings work for most projects on Snyk, but if you have a custom setup, you\\\\n  // can configure the following settings.\\\\n\\\\n  // This regular expression is matched on the repository name. The values from the capture groups are\\\\n  // available in the templates below.\\\\n  \\\\\\\"snyk.repositoryNamePattern\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"(?:^|/)([^/]+)/([^/]+)$\\\\\\\",\\\\n  // This template is used to form the Snyk organization key.\\\\n  // By default, the second-last part of the repository name (first capture group above) is used as-is.\\\\n  // E.g. \\\\\\\"apache\\\\\\\" from \\\\\\\"github.com/apache/struts\\\\\\\".\\\\n  \\\\\\\"snyk.organizationKeyTemplate\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$1\\\\\\\",\\\\n\\\\n  // CORS headers are necessary for the extension to fetch data, but Snyk does not send them by default.\\\\n  // Here you can customize the URL to an HTTP proxy that adds CORS headers.\\\\n  // By default Sourcegraph's CORS proxy is used.\\\\n  \\\\\\\"snyk.corsAnywhereUrl\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://cors-anywhere.herokuapp.com\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"repository\\\": {\\n    \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/sourcegraph/sourcegraph-snyk\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"parcel build --out-file dist/snyk.js src/snyk.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"cover\\\": \\\"TS_NODE_COMPILER_OPTIONS='{\\\\\\\"module\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"commonjs\\\\\\\"}' nyc --require ts-node/register --require source-map-support/register --all mocha --opts mocha.opts --timeout 10000\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"eslint 'src/**/*.ts'\\\",\\n    \\\"serve\\\": \\\"yarn run symlink-package \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 parcel serve --no-hmr --out-file dist/snyk.js src/snyk.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph:prepublish\\\": \\\"yarn run typecheck \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 yarn run build\\\",\\n    \\\"symlink-package\\\": \\\"mkdirp dist \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 lnfs ./package.json ./dist/package.json\\\",\\n    \\\"test\\\": \\\"TS_NODE_COMPILER_OPTIONS='{\\\\\\\"module\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"commonjs\\\\\\\"}' mocha --require ts-node/register --require source-map-support/register --opts mocha.opts\\\",\\n    \\\"typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:build\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.dist.json -w\\\",\\n    \\\"watch:typecheck\\\": \\\"tsc -p tsconfig.json -w\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"tags\\\": [],\\n  \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://sourcegraph.com/-/static/extension/8886-sourcegraph-snyk.js?c6mldb32ej7k--sourcegraph-snyk\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.0.0-DEVELOPMENT\\\",\\n  \\\"wip\\\": true\\n}\",\"description\":\"Provides code insights from Snyk reports\"},\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-26T03:51:43Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2020-10-26T03:51:43Z\",\"url\":\"/extensions/sourcegraph/snyk\",\"remoteURL\":null,\"registryName\":\"\",\"isLocal\":true,\"isWorkInProgress\":true,\"viewerCanAdminister\":false},{\"id\":\"UmVnaXN0cnlFeHRlbnNpb246eyJsIjozMDF9\",\"publisher\":{\"__typename\":\"Org\",\"id\":\"T3JnOjE=\",\"name\":\"sourcegraph\",\"displayName\":\"Sourcegraph\",\"url\":\"/organizations/sourcegraph\"},\"extensionID\":\"sourcegraph/find-replace\",\"extensionIDWithoutRegistry\":\"sourcegraph/find-replace\",\"name\":\"find-replace\",\"manifest\":{\"raw\":\"{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sourcegraph/sourcegraph/main/client/shared/src/schema/extension.schema.json\\\",\\n  \\\"activationEvents\\\": [\\n    \\\"*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"browserslist\\\": [\\n    \\\"last 1 Chrome versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Firefox versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Edge versions\\\",\\n    \\\"last 1 Safari versions\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"categories\\\": [],\\n  \\\"contributes\\\": {\\n    \\\"actions\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"actionItem\\\": {\\n          \\\"label\\\": \\\"Find-replace\\\"\\n        },\\n        \\\"command\\\": \\\"findReplace.startFindReplace\\\",\\n        \\\"commandArguments\\\": [\\n          \\\"${get(context, 'searchQuery')}\\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"findReplace.startFindReplace\\\",\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"Create a new find-replace campaign\\\"\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"configuration\\\": {},\\n    \\\"menus\\\": {\\n      \\\"commandPalette\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"action\\\": \\\"findReplace.startFindReplace\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"search/results/toolbar\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"action\\\": \\\"findReplace.startFindReplace\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/campaigns-client\\\": \\\"file:../campaigns-client\\\",\\n    \\\"rxjs\\\": \\\"^6.6.3\\\",\\n    \\\"slugify\\\": \\\"^1.4.5\\\",\\n    \\\"ts-node\\\": \\\"^9.0.0\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/eslint-config\\\": \\\"^0.20.11\\\",\\n    \\\"@sourcegraph/tsconfig\\\": \\\"^4.0.1\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/assert\\\": \\\"^1.5.2\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/mocha\\\": \\\"^8.0.3\\\",\\n    \\\"assert\\\": \\\"^2.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"^7.11.0\\\",\\n    \\\"lnfs-cli\\\": \\\"^2.1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"mkdirp\\\": \\\"^1.0.4\\\",\\n    \\\"mocha\\\": \\\"^8.2.0\\\",\\n    \\\"parcel-bundler\\\": \\\"^1.12.4\\\",\\n    \\\"prettier\\\": \\\"^2.1.2\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph\\\": \\\"^24.7.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^4.0.3\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"extensionID\\\": \\\"sourcegraph/find-replace\\\",\\n  \\\"license\\\": \\\"Apache-2.0\\\",\\n  \\\"main\\\": \\\"dist/find-replace.js\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"find-replace\\\",\\n  \\\"publisher\\\": \\\"sourcegraph\\\",\\n  \\\"readme\\\": \\\"# Find-replace campaigns (Sourcegraph extension)\\\\n\\\\nCreate Sourcegraph campaigns that perform a find-replace on multiple files in multiple repositories.\\\\n\\\\n## What are Sourcegraph campaigns?\\\\n\\\\nCampaigns let you make code changes across many repositories and code hosts. Read more about [campaigns in the Sourcegraph docs.](https://docs.sourcegraph.com/campaigns)\\\\n\\\\n## How does a find-replace campaign work?\\\\n\\\\nA find-replace campaign is a campaign that finds all matches of a given string and replaces them with a replacement string.\\\\n\\\\n- Perform a search on Sourcegraph\\\\n- In the search results toolbar, click \\\\\\\"Find-replace\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Enter the string to find\\\\n- Enter the replacement string\\\\n- Once the process is complete, click the notification to open the newly created campaign.\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"parcel build --out-file dist/find-replace.js src/find-replace.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"eslint\\\": \\\"eslint 'src/**/*.ts'\\\",\\n    \\\"prettier\\\": \\\"prettier '**/*.{ts,md,json}' --write --list-different\\\",\\n    \\\"serve\\\": \\\"yarn run symlink-package \\\\u0026\\\\u0026 parcel serve --no-hmr --out-file dist/find-replace.js src/find-replace.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"sourcegraph:prepublish\\\": \\\"yarn run build\\\",\\n    \\\"symlink-package\\\": \\\"mkdirp dist 